[
    {
        "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60001",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "Home Heating alerts",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Forwards the Home Heating watchdog alerts from MQTT to Telegram.\nReplace the Telegram sender by a Signal node to use Signal.",
        "env": []
    },
    {
        "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60002",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "a1b2c3d4e5f60001",
        "name": "Home Heating alerts (readme)",
        "info": "# Home Heating alerts\n\n- `home_heating/alert`: a check changed (error / warning / ok again), or is still failing (repeat)\n- `home_heating/heartbeat`: every run. No heartbeat for 5 minutes: Home Assistant or the integration stopped\n\nSet your Telegram chat id in **Settings** and select your bot in the Telegram sender.\nFor Signal: replace the Telegram sender by your Signal node, `msg.payload.content` holds the text.",
        "x": 170,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60003",
        "type": "mqtt in",
        "z": "a1b2c3d4e5f60001",
